ws for both setting defaults, or conditional defaults for both fields and for form control HTML attributes. A notable extension, included here, is displaying different label and help text for address form fields to adjust between assuming a local country postal format vs. a more international format while adding a country field (but only when needed). ","topics":[],"score":264700,"global_rank":44561},{"name":"jspaezp/elfragmentador-data","owner":"jspaezp","html_url":"https://github.com/jspaezp/elfragmentador-data","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":264690,"global_rank":44573},{"name":"machineagency/jubilee_controller","owner":"machineagency","html_url":"https://github.com/machineagency/jubilee_controller","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"jubilee directed under the guidance of python","topics":[],"score":264690,"global_rank":44574},{"name":"conge/freya_running","owner":"conge","html_url":"https://github.com/conge/freya_running","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Running page for Freya","topics":[],"score":264685,"global_rank":44578},{"name":"AllenInstitute/ophys_ephys_comparison_paper","owner":"AllenInstitute","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenInstitute/ophys_ephys_comparison_paper","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Code for generating figures from Siegle, Ledochowitsch et al. (2021) eLife","topics":[],"score":264678,"global_rank":44586},{"name":"njhofmann/rl-compiler-optimization","owner":"njhofmann","html_url":"https://github.com/njhofmann/rl-compiler-optimization","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Evaluation of the CompilerGym environment using reinforcement learning agents from StableBaselines v3","topics":[],"score":264672,"global_rank":44594},{"name":"deysuman/machine-learning","owner":"deysuman","html_url":"https:/